cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "PUFAnalytics: A Research-Grade Toolkit for the Evaluation of Physically Unclonable Functions"
abstract: >-
  PUFAnalytics is a Python library and in-browser workbench for evaluating
  Physically Unclonable Functions (PUFs): standard quality metrics with
  bootstrap confidence intervals, identification statistics (decidability,
  EER, binomial FAR/FRR), NIST SP 800-22 randomness tests, NIST SP 800-90B
  entropy estimates, reproducible PUF simulators, machine-learning modelling
  attacks and fuzzy-extractor key-generation planning.
authors:
